<Tv title="Spackle: a white paper" description="How Spackle's self-contained polyfills compare with core-js across 24 Chromium WebViews (41 to 150), plus a real-device example on a 2017 LG TV: method, results, checks and raw data.">
  <style is:inline>
    .paper h2 { margin-top: 2.6rem; padding-bottom: 0.4rem; border-bottom: 2px solid #cfccc5; }
    .paper table { font-size: 0.85rem; }
    .paper td.num, .paper th.num { text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; }
    .paper td.c, .paper th.c { text-align: center; white-space: nowrap; }
