        <tr><td><b>{m}</b></td>{v.map((x, i) => <td class="c">{i === 0 ? <b>{x}</b> : x}</td>)}</tr>
      ))}
    </table></div>
    <p class="dim">From Chromium 69 both libraries step aside for native built-ins and the two are level.</p>

    <h3>Hot paths, by Chromium version</h3>
    <p class="dim">How many times faster Spackle's polyfill ran than core-js's. ≈ means within 10%.</p>
    <div class="scroll"><table>
