    </table></div>

    <h2 id="real-hardware">5. Real hardware</h2>
    <p>A 2017 LG smart TV, webOS 3.5, Chromium 38. Both results are from the same physical TV, read from the device's own performance trace.</p>
    <h3>Application: SolidTV demo</h3>
    <p class="dim">The <a href="https://github.com/solid-tv/solid-demo-app">SolidTV demo app</a>, default build against the same build with Spackle. Five-run medians.</p>
    <div class="scroll"><table>
